    <briefdescription>
<para>A predicate (range) lock held by a cross-shard transaction on one shard. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Represents the range [<computeroutput>start_key</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>end_key</computeroutput>] inclusive on both ends. When <computeroutput>end_key</computeroutput> is empty the lock covers only the single key <computeroutput>start_key</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
